cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'To cite package "gtropic" in publications use:'
type: software
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
title: 'gtropic: Retrieve, Filter, and Plot G-TROPIC Global Tropical Cyclone Exposure
  Data (1980-Present)'
version: 0.0.0.9002
abstract: A retrieval, filtering, and plotting client for the live (updated weekly)
  G-TROPIC collection of tropical cyclone exposure datasets published on Harvard Dataverse.
  Exposure datasets include wind, precipitation, and flooding data at second-level
  administrative unit (ADM2) resolution for every ADM2 and International Best Track
  Archive for Climate Stewardship (IBTrACS) recorded storm globally, from 1980 to
  the present. Provides a single cornerstone query function, discovery helpers for
  exploring the available vocabulary of administrative units and storms, version manifests
  for reproducible re-retrieval, and an on-disk cache enabled by default. The package
  performs no scientific recomputation, published exposure columns are authoritative.
